 "_source": "The default world: keep owners and levels and keep door health/state as in the original v0.32 world (the last release built before any test runs changed them); the two battleground keeps added later (Dun Abermenai, Dun Murdaigean) as shipped in 0.35. build_release_036.py resets the release world to these and verifies it."
